<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amway Asia said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amway Asia said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities upgraded Amway Asia Pacific to buy from hold, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 33-5/8 Tuesday in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
